1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,300
Slide 37 covers CUSTOMIZING THE AGENT PORTAL: Configuration by Discipline.

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,564
In Spark OS, you never hardcode settings!

3
00:00:09,564 --> 00:00:15,153
Everything is configured through a clean, version-controlled `config.yaml` file.

4
00:00:15,153 --> 00:00:17,740
Look at the three settings on screen:

5
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,190
Setting 1: Hotkey Re-binding.

6
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:30,090
You can re-bind the trigger key to `Win + Shift + Space` or `Alt + J` so it never collides with PowerToys Run or existing developer hotkeys.

7
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,369
Setting 2: Domain Whitelists!

8
00:00:32,369 --> 00:00:40,470
You lock the agent's network egress strictly to authorized enterprise endpoints, blocking all third-party analytics trackers.

9
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:43,401
And Setting 3: Model Tier Routing!

10
00:00:43,401 --> 00:00:53,230
Route simple file searches and calculator math to an on-device 2B model, and route complex multimodal synthesis to Gemini 3.5 Flash!

11
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:59,530
That cuts your cloud token costs by 60% while giving you lightning speed on local tasks!

12
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:06,770
Clean configuration architecture gives you maximum flexibility while preserving strict enterprise boundaries.

